e</p></article><article><span>02</span><strong>Automation</strong><p>Dynamo &amp; Python · C# - Revit/Civil 3D API · .NET &amp; WPF · Git/GitHub</p></article></div></main><aside><div class="portfolio-about__photo" data-portfolio-profile-photo-frame><span aria-hidden="true">HDL</span><img src="/assets/profile/profile.jpg" alt="HUYNH DUC LUONG" data-portfolio-profile-photo></div><h2>HUYNH DUC LUONG</h2><p>BIM Coordinator - Infrastructure</p><address><a href="mailto:huynhluong321998@gmail.com">huynhluong321998@gmail.com</a><strong>0348299911</strong><span>Thu Duc City, Ho Chi Minh, Viet Nam</span></address></aside></div><footer class="portfolio-page-footer"><span>BIM · Infrastructure · Automation</span><strong>02 / 06</strong></footer></section><section class="portfolio-page portfolio-page--index portfolio-page--index-visual" data-portfolio-layout="index.visual"><header class="portfolio-page-header"><strong>HUYNH DUC LUONG</strong><span>Project index</span></header><div class="portfolio-page__inner portfolio-index-page portfolio-index-page--visual"><p class="portfolio-kicker">Selected work / 01 projects</p><h2 class="portfolio-title">Project index</h2><div class="portfolio-index-visual"><article><div><div class="portfolio-image-placeholder portfolio-index__image" data-crop-profile="wide"><span>Project image placeholder</span></div><span>01</span></div><h3>Duong giao thong ra dao Hon Khoai</h3><p><span class="portfolio-index__location">Ca Mau</span><span class="portfolio-index__role">BIM Coordinator</span></p></article></div></div><footer class="portfolio-page-footer"><span>BIM · Infrastructure · Automation</span><strong>03 / 06</strong></footer></section><section class="portfolio-page portfolio-page--project portfolio-page--project-balanced" data-portfolio-layout="project.balanced"><header class="portfolio-page-header"><strong>HUYNH DUC LUONG</strong><span>Selected work</span></header><div class="portfolio-project portfolio-project--balanced"><div class="portfolio-project-heading"><p class="portfolio-kicker">01 / Ca Mau</p><h2>Duong giao thong ra dao Hon Khoai</h2><strong>BIM Coordinator</strong></div><div class="portfolio-project__balanced-grid"><div><figure><div class="portfolio-image-placeholder portfolio-project-image" data-crop-profile="wide"><span>Project image placeholder</span></div><figcaption>01 / Coordinated model overview</figcaption></figure><div class="portfolio-project-facts"><div><strong>8</strong><span>Tools</span></div><p>The project includes Viet Nam&#39;s longest sea-crossing bridge, extending over 18 km and representing an investment of more than VND 25.7 trillion. It connects the Dat Mui area to the Hon Khoai dual-use port in Ca Mau Province.</p></div></div><aside><p class="portfolio-kicker">My contribution</p><div class="portfolio-contributions"><article><span>01</span><p>Led the BIM modeling team and coordinated multidisciplinary models.</p></article><article><span>02</span><p>Reviewed model quality and resolved coordination and clash issues.</p></article><article><span>03</span><p>Managed BIM models and deliverables through Autodesk Construction Cloud.</p></article></div><ul class="portfolio-tags"><li>Revit</li><li>Civil 3D</li><li>Navisworks</li><li>ACC</li><li>C#</li><li>WPF</li><li>Dynamo</li><li>Python</li></ul></aside></div></div><footer class="portfolio-page-footer"><span>BIM · Infrastructure · Automation</span><strong>04 / 06</strong></footer></section><section class="portfolio-page portfolio-page--automation portfolio-page--automation-workflow" data-portfolio-layout="automation.workflow"><header class="portfolio-page-header"><strong>HUYNH DUC LUONG</strong><span>Selected BIM automation</span></header><div class="portfolio-automation portfolio-automation--workflow"><p class="portfolio-kicker">Selected BIM automation / 01</p><h2>Bridge Deck Generator</h2><p class="portfolio-automation__subtitle">Tools built around real delivery constraints.</p><div class="portfolio-automation__workflow-grid"><aside><section><p class="portfolio-kicker">The challenge</p><p>Creating complex bridge deck geometry manually is time-consuming and difficult to update.</p></section><section><p class="portfolio-kicker">The approach</p><p>A Civil 3D and Revit workflow that generates bridge deck geometry from alignment, profile, width, and superelevation data.</p></section><ul class="portfolio-tags"><li>C#</li><li>Revit API</li><li>Civil 3D API</li><li>WPF</li></ul></aside><main><figure class="portfolio-automation__visual"><div class="portfolio-image-placeholder portfolio-automation__image" data-crop-profile="wide"><span>Project image placeholder</span></div><figcaption>Tool workflow or output</figcaption></figure></main></div></div><footer class="portfolio-page-footer"><span>BIM · Infrastructure · Automation</span><strong>05 / 06</strong></footer></section><section class="portfolio-page portfolio-page--closing portfolio-page--closing-blue" data-portfolio-layout="closing.blue"><div class="portfolio-closing portfolio-closing--blue"><h2>Thank you</h2><strong>Let’s build clearer BIM workflows.</strong><p>Infrastructure BIM coordination · Model quality · Automation</p><address><div><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:huynhluong321998@gmail.com">huynhluong321998@gmail.com</a></div><div><span>Phone</span><strong>0348299911</strong></div><div><span>Location</span><strong>Thu Duc City, Ho Chi Minh, Viet Nam</strong></div></address></div><span class="portfolio-page-number">06 / 06</span></section>"`;

